            <p>Travel insurance protects you if you need to cancel a trip (medical, family emergency), lose baggage, or face travel delays — none of which are covered by health insurance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="msv__feature-item">
          <span class="msv__feature-icon">🔄</span>
          <div>
            <h4>During Visa Renewal Periods</h4>
            <p>If you travel while your visa renewal is being processed (even though you shouldn't), travel insurance ensures you have medical coverage if something goes wrong abroad.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="msv__feature-item">
          <span class="msv__feature-icon">🆙</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Gap Coverage Between Policies</h4>
            <p>If there's a gap between your old residential insurance expiring and a new policy starting, travel insurance fills the void.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
